   242	    H1 fail-CLOSED: the `CEO_PAIR_RAIL_PIN_MANIFEST` override is a TEST
   243	    seam honoured ONLY under `CEO_PAIR_RAIL_TEST_MODE=1`. On the LIVE path
   244	    the override is IGNORED and the manifest base resolves under the
   245	    framework-wide `CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` anchor. The seam never relaxes the
   246	    sha comparison — a test manifest is still matched byte-for-byte against
   247	    the resolved payload.
