   249	    Scope (PLAN-163 DIM1): the guarantee "no env redirects verification at
   250	    an attacker-supplied manifest" is scoped to CODEX-SPECIFIC seams. The
   251	    base still follows `CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` — the framework-wide anchor
   252	    every hook already trusts — so an attacker who can repoint that anchor
