     4	`check-tier-boundaries.py` (filesystem rglob) and `check-contamination.sh`
     5	(git ls-files), exposing a single API:
     6	
     7	    walker = FileWalker(
     8	        repo_root=Path("."),
     9	        mode="filesystem" | "git",
    10	        suffixes={".md", ".yaml"},
    11	        skip_subdir_names={"benchmarks"},
    12	        path_allowlist_exact={"LICENSE"},
    13	        path_allowlist_globs={".claude/skills/domains/*"},
