codex
I found a compatibility issue: Rule 1 rejects Git symlinks materialized as regular files under `core.symlinks=false`, although Rule 2 supports them. There are also two lower-priority gaps: the subprocess census misses aliases inherited by nested helpers, and the archive validator accepts layout shapes the restore caller silently skips. None appears to falsify a declared condition.
